<?xml version='1.0' encoding='UTF-8'?><?xml-stylesheet href="http://www.blogger.com/styles/atom.css" type="text/css"?><feed xmlns='http://www.w3.org/2005/Atom' xmlns:openSearch='http://a9.com/-/spec/opensearchrss/1.0/' xmlns:gd="http://schemas.google.com/g/2005"><id>tag:blogger.com,1999:blog-32869165.post4005157469798197354..comments</id><updated>2017-04-13T04:47:21.148-06:00</updated><title type='text'>Comments on Pro Libertate: &quot;Punishment Has Been Achieved&quot; (Update, August 16) </title><link rel='http://schemas.google.com/g/2005#feed' type='application/atom+xml' href='http://freedominourtime.blogspot.com/feeds/comments/default'/><link rel='self' type='application/atom+xml' href='http://www.blogger.com/feeds/32869165/4005157469798197354/comments/default'/><link rel='alternate' type='text/html' href='http://freedominourtime.blogspot.com/2013/08/punishment-has-been-achieved.html'/><link rel="hub" href="http://pubsubhubbub.appspot.com/"/><author><name>William N. Grigg</name><uri>http://www.blogger.com/profile/14368220509514750246</uri><email>noreply@blogger.com</email><gd:image rel='http://schemas.google.com/g/2005#thumbnail' width='32' height='19' src='http://3.bp.blogspot.com/-5rhFUXs_62I/VgVL2E3rMII/AAAAAAAAMJ4/cjJOyI7W208/s220/Photo%2BRon%2BPaul%2BLiberty%2BReport.jpg'/></author><generator version='7.00' uri='http://www.blogger.com'>Blogger</generator><openSearch:totalResults>22</openSearch:totalResults><openSearch:startIndex>1</openSearch:startIndex><openSearch:itemsPerPage>25</openSearch:itemsPerPage><entry><id>tag:blogger.com,1999:blog-32869165.post-1429546953072646788</id><published>2013-09-07T21:08:57.859-06:00</published><updated>2013-09-07T21:08:57.859-06:00</updated><title type='text'>Mr. Grigg,&#xa;&#xa;I appreciate your response.  I&amp;#39;ve ...</title><content type='html'>Mr. Grigg,&lt;br /&gt;&lt;br /&gt;I appreciate your response.  I&amp;#39;ve become aware of responses from other individuals to my previous comments, and I can assure you that there are no &amp;quot;spells&amp;quot; being cast, and there are no &amp;quot;threats&amp;quot; from my end, just concerns.  If these individuals would read the comments again, they would understand how harmless they are.  </content><link rel='edit' type='application/atom+xml' href='http://www.blogger.com/feeds/32869165/4005157469798197354/comments/default/1429546953072646788'/><link rel='self' type='application/atom+xml' href='http://www.blogger.com/feeds/32869165/4005157469798197354/comments/default/1429546953072646788'/><link rel='alternate' type='text/html' href='http://freedominourtime.blogspot.com/2013/08/punishment-has-been-achieved.html?showComment=1378609737859#c1429546953072646788' title=''/><author><name>Tom Wilcox</name><email>noreply@blogger.com</email><gd:image rel='http://schemas.google.com/g/2005#thumbnail' width='16' height='16' src='http://img1.blogblog.com/img/blank.gif'/></author><thr:in-reply-to xmlns:thr='http://purl.org/syndication/thread/1.0' href='http://freedominourtime.blogspot.com/2013/08/punishment-has-been-achieved.html' ref='tag:blogger.com,1999:blog-32869165.post-4005157469798197354' source='http://www.blogger.com/feeds/32869165/posts/default/4005157469798197354' type='text/html'/><gd:extendedProperty name="blogger.itemClass" value="pid-1088128349"/><gd:extendedProperty name="blogger.displayTime" value="September 7, 2013 at 9:08 PM"/></entry><entry><id>tag:blogger.com,1999:blog-32869165.post-8242877092042685909</id><published>2013-09-01T23:37:40.266-06:00</published><updated>2013-09-01T23:37:40.266-06:00</updated><title type='text'>Mr. Wilcox, I earnestly reciprocate your good wish...</title><content type='html'>Mr. Wilcox, I earnestly reciprocate your good wishes. :-)&lt;br /&gt;&lt;br /&gt;Rita Hutchens has been wronged. I don&amp;#39;t know anything about Mr. Greenbank&amp;#39;s personal life, but what he did to Rita Hutchens is objectively evil, and this matter can&amp;#39;t be put to rest until she is given redress, and Greenbank is held to account. The is true of Scott Campbell, who instigated the retaliatory campaign against Hutchens, and Teresa Heberer, who assaulted her and illegally arrested her. &lt;br /&gt;&lt;br /&gt;The &lt;i&gt;only&lt;/i&gt; thing that prevents this situation from being resolved is the intransigence of the corrupt people who created it.</content><link rel='edit' type='application/atom+xml' href='http://www.blogger.com/feeds/32869165/4005157469798197354/comments/default/8242877092042685909'/><link rel='self' type='application/atom+xml' href='http://www.blogger.com/feeds/32869165/4005157469798197354/comments/default/8242877092042685909'/><link rel='alternate' type='text/html' href='http://freedominourtime.blogspot.com/2013/08/punishment-has-been-achieved.html?showComment=1378100260266#c8242877092042685909' title=''/><author><name>William N. Grigg</name><uri>http://www.blogger.com/profile/14368220509514750246</uri><email>noreply@blogger.com</email><gd:image rel='http://schemas.google.com/g/2005#thumbnail' width='32' height='22' src='http://4.bp.blogspot.com/-Ol6GVktahVU/UhwPgHyhnNI/AAAAAAAAJeQ/ik4eBjgEKPs/s220/New%2BHeadshot.JPG'/></author><thr:in-reply-to xmlns:thr='http://purl.org/syndication/thread/1.0' href='http://freedominourtime.blogspot.com/2013/08/punishment-has-been-achieved.html' ref='tag:blogger.com,1999:blog-32869165.post-4005157469798197354' source='http://www.blogger.com/feeds/32869165/posts/default/4005157469798197354' type='text/html'/><gd:extendedProperty name="blogger.itemClass" value="pid-1344012943"/><gd:extendedProperty name="blogger.displayTime" value="September 1, 2013 at 11:37 PM"/></entry><entry><id>tag:blogger.com,1999:blog-32869165.post-2787230389890497453</id><published>2013-09-01T23:08:23.709-06:00</published><updated>2013-09-01T23:08:23.709-06:00</updated><title type='text'>Mr. Grigg, &#xa;&#xa;Thank you for your response.  I under...</title><content type='html'>Mr. Grigg, &lt;br /&gt;&lt;br /&gt;Thank you for your response.  I understand your concerns, and hopefully this Greenbank/Hutcheons situation can be resolved soon.  Looking at all the facts, neither prosecutor nor defendant seems evil, so maybe there can be more positive actions from now on, and the matter can be put to rest?  Anyway, good health to you and yours...</content><link rel='edit' type='application/atom+xml' href='http://www.blogger.com/feeds/32869165/4005157469798197354/comments/default/2787230389890497453'/><link rel='self' type='application/atom+xml' href='http://www.blogger.com/feeds/32869165/4005157469798197354/comments/default/2787230389890497453'/><link rel='alternate' type='text/html' href='http://freedominourtime.blogspot.com/2013/08/punishment-has-been-achieved.html?showComment=1378098503709#c2787230389890497453' title=''/><author><name>Tom Wilcox</name><email>noreply@blogger.com</email><gd:image rel='http://schemas.google.com/g/2005#thumbnail' width='16' height='16' src='http://img1.blogblog.com/img/blank.gif'/></author><thr:in-reply-to xmlns:thr='http://purl.org/syndication/thread/1.0' href='http://freedominourtime.blogspot.com/2013/08/punishment-has-been-achieved.html' ref='tag:blogger.com,1999:blog-32869165.post-4005157469798197354' source='http://www.blogger.com/feeds/32869165/posts/default/4005157469798197354' type='text/html'/><gd:extendedProperty name="blogger.itemClass" value="pid-217536337"/><gd:extendedProperty name="blogger.displayTime" value="September 1, 2013 at 11:08 PM"/></entry><entry><id>tag:blogger.com,1999:blog-32869165.post-2962365395322892918</id><published>2013-09-01T07:20:43.193-06:00</published><updated>2013-09-01T07:20:43.193-06:00</updated><title type='text'>Mr. Wilcox, I appreciate your kindness, and your c...</title><content type='html'>Mr. Wilcox, I appreciate your kindness, and your concern. I am outraged over the treatment Rita Hutchens has endured -- what honest and decent person wouldn&amp;#39;t be? -- and it&amp;#39;s not an exaggeration to say that the behavior of both Greenbank and Scott Campbell. &lt;br /&gt;&lt;br /&gt;Since publishing the last piece about this case, I&amp;#39;ve published three lengthy essays about other subjects here at Pro Libertate, and several others elsewhere. This suggests that my abiding interest in the Hutchens case doesn&amp;#39;t amount to an obsession. &lt;br /&gt;&lt;br /&gt;On the other hand, Greenbank spent the better part of a year -- and a great deal of money extracted from Idaho taxpayers -- in pursuing a patently phony battery charge against a helpless and inoffensive woman. Could this not be characterized as an obsession -- and one that was both vicious and destructive? &lt;br /&gt;&lt;br /&gt;Once again, I appreciate your concern, but don&amp;#39;t be troubled about this matter. Among the sources of stress and frustration that afflict me, the Hutchens case makes a very modest contribution.</content><link rel='edit' type='application/atom+xml' href='http://www.blogger.com/feeds/32869165/4005157469798197354/comments/default/2962365395322892918'/><link rel='self' type='application/atom+xml' href='http://www.blogger.com/feeds/32869165/4005157469798197354/comments/default/2962365395322892918'/><link rel='alternate' type='text/html' href='http://freedominourtime.blogspot.com/2013/08/punishment-has-been-achieved.html?showComment=1378041643193#c2962365395322892918' title=''/><author><name>William N. Grigg</name><uri>http://www.blogger.com/profile/14368220509514750246</uri><email>noreply@blogger.com</email><gd:image rel='http://schemas.google.com/g/2005#thumbnail' width='32' height='22' src='http://4.bp.blogspot.com/-Ol6GVktahVU/UhwPgHyhnNI/AAAAAAAAJeQ/ik4eBjgEKPs/s220/New%2BHeadshot.JPG'/></author><thr:in-reply-to xmlns:thr='http://purl.org/syndication/thread/1.0' href='http://freedominourtime.blogspot.com/2013/08/punishment-has-been-achieved.html' ref='tag:blogger.com,1999:blog-32869165.post-4005157469798197354' source='http://www.blogger.com/feeds/32869165/posts/default/4005157469798197354' type='text/html'/><gd:extendedProperty name="blogger.itemClass" value="pid-1344012943"/><gd:extendedProperty name="blogger.displayTime" value="September 1, 2013 at 7:20 AM"/></entry><entry><id>tag:blogger.com,1999:blog-32869165.post-3468057695693437853</id><published>2013-08-31T22:40:36.383-06:00</published><updated>2013-08-31T22:40:36.383-06:00</updated><title type='text'>Mr. Grigg,&#xa;&#xa;Your articles are interesting, and tho...</title><content type='html'>Mr. Grigg,&lt;br /&gt;&lt;br /&gt;Your articles are interesting, and thought-provoking, however, I&amp;#39;m concerned the effects this obsession (pardon the expression) could have on your health.  Maybe it&amp;#39;s time to possibly move on?  I&amp;#39;m only saying this because it seems the focus on Greenbank seems quite personal.  We&amp;#39;d like to see you still writing for a long time, and be in good health, because I know that worrying about an individual this much could cause issues...I&amp;#39;m only voicing a concern...</content><link rel='edit' type='application/atom+xml' href='http://www.blogger.com/feeds/32869165/4005157469798197354/comments/default/3468057695693437853'/><link rel='self' type='application/atom+xml' href='http://www.blogger.com/feeds/32869165/4005157469798197354/comments/default/3468057695693437853'/><link rel='alternate' type='text/html' href='http://freedominourtime.blogspot.com/2013/08/punishment-has-been-achieved.html?showComment=1378010436383#c3468057695693437853' title=''/><author><name>Tom Wilcox</name><email>noreply@blogger.com</email><gd:image rel='http://schemas.google.com/g/2005#thumbnail' width='16' height='16' src='http://img1.blogblog.com/img/blank.gif'/></author><thr:in-reply-to xmlns:thr='http://purl.org/syndication/thread/1.0' href='http://freedominourtime.blogspot.com/2013/08/punishment-has-been-achieved.html' ref='tag:blogger.com,1999:blog-32869165.post-4005157469798197354' source='http://www.blogger.com/feeds/32869165/posts/default/4005157469798197354' type='text/html'/><gd:extendedProperty name="blogger.itemClass" value="pid-1546797579"/><gd:extendedProperty name="blogger.displayTime" value="August 31, 2013 at 10:40 PM"/></entry><entry><id>tag:blogger.com,1999:blog-32869165.post-6571414109078447851</id><published>2013-08-23T13:04:48.630-06:00</published><updated>2013-08-23T13:04:48.630-06:00</updated><title type='text'>Comrade we live in the golden rainbow utopia with ...</title><content type='html'>Comrade we live in the golden rainbow utopia with each according to his needs and ruled over by the immaculate water walking messiah, the one! If these evildoers didn&amp;#39;t have something to hide the brave noble heroes in XXXXL tactical gear wouldn&amp;#39;t have any reason to bother them. The state is omnipotent and immaculate like our water walking chicago toilet water to wine converting messiah! Yes we can comrade! To each according to his needs, workers of the world unite. The precious equalocracy that oprah viewers pined for and voted for is here now let&amp;#39;s enjoy the misery together tovarisch.</content><link rel='edit' type='application/atom+xml' href='http://www.blogger.com/feeds/32869165/4005157469798197354/comments/default/6571414109078447851'/><link rel='self' type='application/atom+xml' href='http://www.blogger.com/feeds/32869165/4005157469798197354/comments/default/6571414109078447851'/><link rel='alternate' type='text/html' href='http://freedominourtime.blogspot.com/2013/08/punishment-has-been-achieved.html?showComment=1377284688630#c6571414109078447851' title=''/><author><name>Anonymous</name><email>noreply@blogger.com</email><gd:image rel='http://schemas.google.com/g/2005#thumbnail' width='16' height='16' src='http://img1.blogblog.com/img/blank.gif'/></author><thr:in-reply-to xmlns:thr='http://purl.org/syndication/thread/1.0' href='http://freedominourtime.blogspot.com/2013/08/punishment-has-been-achieved.html' ref='tag:blogger.com,1999:blog-32869165.post-4005157469798197354' source='http://www.blogger.com/feeds/32869165/posts/default/4005157469798197354' type='text/html'/><gd:extendedProperty name="blogger.itemClass" value="pid-265870678"/><gd:extendedProperty name="blogger.displayTime" value="August 23, 2013 at 1:04 PM"/></entry><entry><id>tag:blogger.com,1999:blog-32869165.post-4472613554119494713</id><published>2013-08-22T13:28:54.485-06:00</published><updated>2013-08-22T13:28:54.485-06:00</updated><title type='text'>Thanks for the support everyone, especially Will, ...</title><content type='html'>Thanks for the support everyone, especially Will, for helping me get my story out. You are a gem we are all fortunate to have around.  Rita Hutchens&lt;br /&gt;&lt;br /&gt;www.ritahutchens.com&lt;br /&gt;www.etsy.com/shop/ritahutchens&lt;br /&gt;rita@ritahutchens.com</content><link rel='edit' type='application/atom+xml' href='http://www.blogger.com/feeds/32869165/4005157469798197354/comments/default/4472613554119494713'/><link rel='self' type='application/atom+xml' href='http://www.blogger.com/feeds/32869165/4005157469798197354/comments/default/4472613554119494713'/><link rel='alternate' type='text/html' href='http://freedominourtime.blogspot.com/2013/08/punishment-has-been-achieved.html?showComment=1377199734485#c4472613554119494713' title=''/><author><name>Rita Hutchens</name><uri>http://www.etsy.com/shop/ritahutchens</uri><email>noreply@blogger.com</email><gd:image rel='http://schemas.google.com/g/2005#thumbnail' width='16' height='16' src='http://img1.blogblog.com/img/blank.gif'/></author><thr:in-reply-to xmlns:thr='http://purl.org/syndication/thread/1.0' href='http://freedominourtime.blogspot.com/2013/08/punishment-has-been-achieved.html' ref='tag:blogger.com,1999:blog-32869165.post-4005157469798197354' source='http://www.blogger.com/feeds/32869165/posts/default/4005157469798197354' type='text/html'/><gd:extendedProperty name="blogger.itemClass" value="pid-1965909553"/><gd:extendedProperty name="blogger.displayTime" value="August 22, 2013 at 1:28 PM"/></entry><entry><id>tag:blogger.com,1999:blog-32869165.post-5370501975359468463</id><published>2013-08-19T07:23:09.220-06:00</published><updated>2013-08-19T07:23:09.220-06:00</updated><title type='text'>Corrupt police, corrupt prosecutors, corrupt judge...</title><content type='html'>Corrupt police, corrupt prosecutors, corrupt judges . . .&lt;br /&gt;&lt;br /&gt;All we have left is the jury.&lt;br /&gt;&lt;br /&gt;Get on a jury and shield your fellow man!&lt;br /&gt;&lt;br /&gt;No victim = No crime = Not guilty = LIBERTY</content><link rel='edit' type='application/atom+xml' href='http://www.blogger.com/feeds/32869165/4005157469798197354/comments/default/5370501975359468463'/><link rel='self' type='application/atom+xml' href='http://www.blogger.com/feeds/32869165/4005157469798197354/comments/default/5370501975359468463'/><link rel='alternate' type='text/html' href='http://freedominourtime.blogspot.com/2013/08/punishment-has-been-achieved.html?showComment=1376918589220#c5370501975359468463' title=''/><author><name>willb</name><email>noreply@blogger.com</email><gd:image rel='http://schemas.google.com/g/2005#thumbnail' width='16' height='16' src='http://img1.blogblog.com/img/blank.gif'/></author><thr:in-reply-to xmlns:thr='http://purl.org/syndication/thread/1.0' href='http://freedominourtime.blogspot.com/2013/08/punishment-has-been-achieved.html' ref='tag:blogger.com,1999:blog-32869165.post-4005157469798197354' source='http://www.blogger.com/feeds/32869165/posts/default/4005157469798197354' type='text/html'/><gd:extendedProperty name="blogger.itemClass" value="pid-1075364918"/><gd:extendedProperty name="blogger.displayTime" value="August 19, 2013 at 7:23 AM"/></entry><entry><id>tag:blogger.com,1999:blog-32869165.post-7265900919086714835</id><published>2013-08-16T17:45:15.267-06:00</published><updated>2013-08-16T17:45:15.267-06:00</updated><title type='text'>These scumbags should be dragged from their homes ...</title><content type='html'> These scumbags should be dragged from their homes in the dark, tarred, feathered and horsewhipped then tied to a post in a public place with a sign reading &amp;quot;Pussies&amp;quot; stapled to their bare asses.&lt;br /&gt;Big bad tuff guys have to be shown how pathetic and weak they are when dealing with men instead of ladies.&lt;br /&gt;Scumbag bullies like these criminal pricks should never be allowed in public service.&lt;br /&gt;&lt;br /&gt;&lt;br /&gt;</content><link rel='edit' type='application/atom+xml' href='http://www.blogger.com/feeds/32869165/4005157469798197354/comments/default/7265900919086714835'/><link rel='self' type='application/atom+xml' href='http://www.blogger.com/feeds/32869165/4005157469798197354/comments/default/7265900919086714835'/><link rel='alternate' type='text/html' href='http://freedominourtime.blogspot.com/2013/08/punishment-has-been-achieved.html?showComment=1376696715267#c7265900919086714835' title=''/><author><name>yanklll</name><uri>http://yanklll.wordpress.com/</uri><email>noreply@blogger.com</email><gd:image rel='http://schemas.google.com/g/2005#thumbnail' width='16' height='16' src='http://img1.blogblog.com/img/openid16-rounded.gif'/></author><thr:in-reply-to xmlns:thr='http://purl.org/syndication/thread/1.0' href='http://freedominourtime.blogspot.com/2013/08/punishment-has-been-achieved.html' ref='tag:blogger.com,1999:blog-32869165.post-4005157469798197354' source='http://www.blogger.com/feeds/32869165/posts/default/4005157469798197354' type='text/html'/><gd:extendedProperty name="blogger.itemClass" value="pid-896917340"/><gd:extendedProperty name="blogger.displayTime" value="August 16, 2013 at 5:45 PM"/></entry><entry><id>tag:blogger.com,1999:blog-32869165.post-847188572308788962</id><published>2013-08-15T21:49:11.783-06:00</published><updated>2013-08-15T21:49:11.783-06:00</updated><title type='text'>And it will all continue until enough of us are so...</title><content type='html'>And it will all continue until enough of us are so sickened by the actions of our corrupt officials that we can no longer stand idly by and allow it.  And then the house cleaning will finally begin.</content><link rel='edit' type='application/atom+xml' href='http://www.blogger.com/feeds/32869165/4005157469798197354/comments/default/847188572308788962'/><link rel='self' type='application/atom+xml' href='http://www.blogger.com/feeds/32869165/4005157469798197354/comments/default/847188572308788962'/><link rel='alternate' type='text/html' href='http://freedominourtime.blogspot.com/2013/08/punishment-has-been-achieved.html?showComment=1376624951783#c847188572308788962' title=''/><author><name>Anonymous</name><email>noreply@blogger.com</email><gd:image rel='http://schemas.google.com/g/2005#thumbnail' width='16' height='16' src='http://img1.blogblog.com/img/blank.gif'/></author><thr:in-reply-to xmlns:thr='http://purl.org/syndication/thread/1.0' href='http://freedominourtime.blogspot.com/2013/08/punishment-has-been-achieved.html' ref='tag:blogger.com,1999:blog-32869165.post-4005157469798197354' source='http://www.blogger.com/feeds/32869165/posts/default/4005157469798197354' type='text/html'/><gd:extendedProperty name="blogger.itemClass" value="pid-585276258"/><gd:extendedProperty name="blogger.displayTime" value="August 15, 2013 at 9:49 PM"/></entry><entry><id>tag:blogger.com,1999:blog-32869165.post-7385283779981498260</id><published>2013-08-15T14:22:08.850-06:00</published><updated>2013-08-15T14:22:08.850-06:00</updated><title type='text'>http://www.wvgazette.com/News/201308150046?page=1&#xa;...</title><content type='html'>http://www.wvgazette.com/News/201308150046?page=1&lt;br /&gt;&lt;br /&gt; This kind of thing makes me sick.</content><link rel='edit' type='application/atom+xml' href='http://www.blogger.com/feeds/32869165/4005157469798197354/comments/default/7385283779981498260'/><link rel='self' type='application/atom+xml' href='http://www.blogger.com/feeds/32869165/4005157469798197354/comments/default/7385283779981498260'/><link rel='alternate' type='text/html' 