rl.org/syndication/thread/1.0' href='http://freedominourtime.blogspot.com/2013/08/punishment-has-been-achieved.html' ref='tag:blogger.com,1999:blog-32869165.post-4005157469798197354' source='http://www.blogger.com/feeds/32869165/posts/default/4005157469798197354' type='text/html'/><gd:extendedProperty name="blogger.itemClass" value="pid-2021786827"/><gd:extendedProperty name="blogger.displayTime" value="August 13, 2013 at 6:59 AM"/></entry><entry><id>tag:blogger.com,1999:blog-32869165.post-5299011910213357371</id><published>2013-08-12T21:17:33.200-06:00</published><updated>2013-08-12T21:17:33.200-06:00</updated><title type='text'>The judges  are just as guilty as the prosecutors....</title><content type='html'>The judges  are just as guilty as the prosecutors. When the judges observe this happening in their courts they should nail and jail the prosecutors. This is especially true when a prosecutor makes the statement &amp;quot;adequately punished&amp;quot; and he drops the charge.&lt;br /&gt;&lt;br /&gt;The USA injustice system is corrupt.</content><link rel='edit' type='application/atom+xml' href='http://www.blogger.com/feeds/32869165/4005157469798197354/comments/default/5299011910213357371'/><link rel='self' type='application/atom+xml' href='http://www.blogger.com/feeds/32869165/4005157469798197354/comments/default/5299011910213357371'/><link rel='alternate' type='text/html' href='http://freedominourtime.blogspot.com/2013/08/punishment-has-been-achieved.html?showComment=1376363853200#c5299011910213357371' title=''/><author><name>Anonymous</name><email>noreply@blogger.com</email><gd:image rel='http://schemas.google.com/g/2005#thumbnail' width='16' height='16' src='http://img1.blogblog.com/img/blank.gif'/></author><thr:in-reply-to xmlns:thr='http://purl.org/syndication/thread/1.0' href='http://freedominourtime.blogspot.com/2013/08/punishment-has-been-achieved.html' ref='tag:blogger.com,1999:blog-32869165.post-4005157469798197354' source='http://www.blogger.com/feeds/32869165/posts/default/4005157469798197354' type='text/html'/><gd:extendedProperty name="blogger.itemClass" value="pid-1516293979"/><gd:extendedProperty name="blogger.displayTime" value="August 12, 2013 at 9:17 PM"/></entry><entry><id>tag:blogger.com,1999:blog-32869165.post-5975185086042675019</id><published>2013-08-12T15:15:37.979-06:00</published><updated>2013-08-12T15:15:37.979-06:00</updated><title type='text'>I have just two words for this crap, and all crap ...</title><content type='html'>I have just two words for this crap, and all crap like it.  JURY NULLIFICATION!  Where applicable, that is.&lt;br /&gt;</content><link rel='edit' type='application/atom+xml' href='http://www.blogger.com/feeds/32869165/4005157469798197354/comments/default/5975185086042675019'/><link rel='self' type='application/atom+xml' href='http://www.blogger.com/feeds/32869165/4005157469798197354/comments/default/5975185086042675019'/><link rel='alternate' type='text/html' href='http://freedominourtime.blogspot.com/2013/08/punishment-has-been-achieved.html?showComment=1376342137979#c5975185086042675019' title=''/><author><name>Love To Push Those Buttons</name><uri>http://www.blogger.com/profile/07646867698193623296</uri><email>noreply@blogger.com</email><gd:image rel='http://schemas.google.com/g/2005#thumbnail' width='16' height='16' src='http://img1.blogblog.com/img/b16-rounded.gif'/></author><thr:in-reply-to xmlns:thr='http://purl.org/syndication/thread/1.0' href='http://freedominourtime.blogspot.com/2013/08/punishment-has-been-achieved.html' ref='tag:blogger.com,1999:blog-32869165.post-4005157469798197354' source='http://www.blogger.com/feeds/32869165/posts/default/4005157469798197354' type='text/html'/><gd:extendedProperty name="blogger.itemClass" value="pid-2140241672"/><gd:extendedProperty name="blogger.displayTime" value="August 12, 2013 at 3:15 PM"/></entry><entry><id>tag:blogger.com,1999:blog-32869165.post-1950018851886076889</id><published>2013-08-12T06:42:58.722-06:00</published><updated>2013-08-12T06:42:58.722-06:00</updated><title type='text'>@ criminal defense attorney in Virginia&#xa;Better lat...</title><content type='html'>@ criminal defense attorney in Virginia&lt;br /&gt;Better late than never. Good for you. Don&amp;#39;t be afraid to spread your story far &amp;amp; wide.</content><link rel='edit' type='application/atom+xml' href='http://www.blogger.com/feeds/32869165/4005157469798197354/comments/default/1950018851886076889'/><link rel='self' type='application/atom+xml' href='http://www.blogger.com/feeds/32869165/4005157469798197354/comments/default/1950018851886076889'/><link rel='alternate' type='text/html' href='http://freedominourtime.blogspot.com/2013/08/punishment-has-been-achieved.html?showComment=1376311378722#c1950018851886076889' title=''/><author><name>Ed</name><uri>http://www.blogger.com/profile/14658730069022837576</uri><email>noreply@blogger.com</email><gd:image rel='http://schemas.google.com/g/2005#thumbnail' width='16' height='16' src='http://img1.blogblog.com/img/b16-rounded.gif'/></author><thr:in-reply-to xmlns:thr='http://purl.org/syndication/thread/1.0' href='http://freedominourtime.blogspot.com/2013/08/punishment-has-been-achieved.html' ref='tag:blogger.com,1999:blog-32869165.post-4005157469798197354' source='http://www.blogger.com/feeds/32869165/posts/default/4005157469798197354' type='text/html'/><gd:extendedProperty name="blogger.itemClass" value="pid-198426585"/><gd:extendedProperty name="blogger.displayTime" value="August 12, 2013 at 6:42 AM"/></entry><entry><id>tag:blogger.com,1999:blog-32869165.post-4671504977133228392</id><published>2013-08-12T06:13:21.350-06:00</published><updated>2013-08-12T06:13:21.350-06:00</updated><title type='text'>The USA &amp;quot;injustice&amp;#39; system goes out of it...</title><content type='html'>The USA &amp;quot;injustice&amp;#39; system goes out of its way to wrongfully incriminate and persecute people. Several days ago I read about police confiscation of property of innocent persons who have no recourse for recovery of their property when the cause of their persecution is proven false.&lt;br /&gt;&lt;br /&gt;This can only be turned around when 51% of the population is wrongly convicted,in jail, and therefore have the majority to have the system fixed.&lt;br /&gt;</content><link rel='edit' type='application/atom+xml' href='http://www.blogger.com/feeds/32869165/4005157469798197354/comments/default/4671504977133228392'/><link rel='self' type='application/atom+xml' href='http://www.blogger.com/feeds/32869165/4005157469798197354/comments/default/4671504977133228392'/><link rel='alternate' type='text/html' href='http://freedominourtime.blogspot.com/2013/08/punishment-has-been-achieved.html?showComment=1376309601350#c4671504977133228392' title=''/><author><name>Anonymous</name><email>noreply@blogger.com</email><gd:image rel='http://schemas.google.com/g/2005#thumbnail' width='16' height='16' src='http://img1.blogblog.com/img/blank.gif'/></author><thr:in-reply-to xmlns:thr='http://purl.org/syndication/thread/1.0' href='http://freedominourtime.blogspot.com/2013/08/punishment-has-been-achieved.html' ref='tag:blogger.com,1999:blog-32869165.post-4005157469798197354' source='http://www.blogger.com/feeds/32869165/posts/default/4005157469798197354' type='text/html'/><gd:extendedProperty name="blogger.itemClass" value="pid-1510048003"/><gd:extendedProperty name="blogger.displayTime" value="August 12, 2013 at 6:13 AM"/></entry><entry><id>tag:blogger.com,1999:blog-32869165.post-5339957431993173093</id><published>2013-08-12T05:30:04.614-06:00</published><updated>2013-08-12T05:30:04.614-06:00</updated><title type='text'>If they&amp;#39;ve pulled this crap on this poor woman...</title><content type='html'>If they&amp;#39;ve pulled this crap on this poor woman these petty jerkwads have done it to numerous others. Nine times out of ten they get away with it - obviously because they are the &amp;quot;system&amp;quot;. However eventually the odds catch up to them and they receive an ass whooping of epic proportions. My advice to the losers inhabiting Sand Point .gov , google Carl Drega - you might learn something.</content><link rel='edit' type='application/atom+xml' href='http://www.blogger.com/feeds/32869165/4005157469798197354/comments/default/5339957431993173093'/><link rel='self' type='application/atom+xml' href='http://www.blogger.com/feeds/32869165/4005157469798197354/comments/default/5339957431993173093'/><link rel='alternate' type='text/html' href='http://freedominourtime.blogspot.com/2013/08/punishment-has-been-achieved.html?showComment=1376307004614#c5339957431993173093' title=''/><author><name>Anonymous</name><email>noreply@blogger.com</email><gd:image rel='http://schemas.google.com/g/2005#thumbnail' width='16' height='16' src='http://img1.blogblog.com/img/blank.gif'/></author><thr:in-reply-to xmlns:thr='http://purl.org/syndication/thread/1.0' href='http://freedominourtime.blogspot.com/2013/08/punishment-has-been-achieved.html' ref='tag:blogger.com,1999:blog-32869165.post-4005157469798197354' source='http://www.blogger.com/feeds/32869165/posts/default/4005157469798197354' type='text/html'/><gd:extendedProperty name="blogger.itemClass" value="pid-859908045"/><gd:extendedProperty name="blogger.displayTime" value="August 12, 2013 at 5:30 AM"/></entry><entry><id>tag:blogger.com,1999:blog-32869165.post-3480838622411679728</id><published>2013-08-11T14:38:41.615-06:00</published><updated>2013-08-11T14:38:41.615-06:00</updated><title type='text'>After only 4 short years as a criminal defense att...</title><content type='html'>After only 4 short years as a criminal defense attorney in Virginia, I can attest incidents such as this are the rule, not the exception. There is no justice in the criminal system, you have no Constitutional rights, and presumption of innocence is a spectre too weak to materialize except sporadically for juries. &lt;br /&gt;&lt;br /&gt;Many prosecutors hide evidence and are only interested in convictions, court costs, and clearing their dockets. I have had the good fortune to know a handful of truly exceptional prosecutors and police officers, but they are too few in number to make a real difference. &lt;br /&gt;&lt;br /&gt;After 4 years believing I was tilting at windmills, I realized I am not Don Quixote, I am a cog in the windmill itself. So I am walking away from my law practice. &lt;br /&gt;&lt;br /&gt;Mr. Grigg, you have been instrumental in my awakening. I remember stumbling upon an article by you on LRC and then reading everything of yours in the archive. The stories you reported mirrored my experiences and painfully made me aware of what little difference I could make inside the machine.&lt;br /&gt;&lt;br /&gt;Thank you.</content><link rel='edit' type='application/atom+xml' href='http://www.blogger.com/feeds/32869165/4005157469798197354/comments/default/3480838622411679728'/><link rel='self' type='application/atom+xml' href='http://www.blogger.com/feeds/32869165/4005157469798197354/comments/default/3480838622411679728'/><link rel='alternate' type='text/html' href='http://freedominourtime.blogspot.com/2013/08/punishment-has-been-achieved.html?showComment=1376253521615#c3480838622411679728' title=''/><author><name>Anonymous</name><email>noreply@blogger.com</email><gd:image rel='http://schemas.google.com/g/2005#thumbnail' width='16' height='16' src='http://img1.blogblog.com/img/blank.gif'/></author><thr:in-reply-to xmlns:thr='http://purl.org/syndication/thread/1.0' href='http://freedominourtime.blogspot.com/2013/08/punishment-has-been-achieved.html' ref='tag:blogger.com,1999:blog-32869165.post-4005157469798197354' source='http://www.blogger.com/feeds/32869165/posts/default/4005157469798197354' type='text/html'/><gd:extendedProperty name="blogger.itemClass" value="pid-309381528"/><gd:extendedProperty name="blogger.displayTime" value="August 11, 2013 at 2:38 PM"/></entry><entry><id>tag:blogger.com,1999:blog-32869165.post-7350293884294143505</id><published>2013-08-11T12:18:50.656-06:00</published><updated>2013-08-11T12:18:50.656-06:00</updated><title type='text'>I once set off to write a short piece (not very we...</title><content type='html'>I once set off to write a short piece (not very well though!), with a mother boasting to her neighbour about her son&amp;#39;s ever so important job and how good he looked in the smart uniform.&lt;br /&gt;&lt;br /&gt;The uniform in my piece had double lightening bolts on the collar, but the concepts, behaviors,  actions, outcomes  and self justifications involved are present wherever and whenever people in costumes claim special privilege over others.&lt;br /&gt;&lt;br /&gt;as long as we have clowns in costumes claiming special privilege we are all Rita Hutchens, or for that matter Anne Frank - we just haven&amp;#39;t run afoul of our snotty little Shane Greenbank &lt;br /&gt;&lt;br /&gt;- yet&lt;br /&gt;&lt;br /&gt;</content><link rel='edit' type='application/atom+xml' href='http://www.blogger.com/feeds/32869165/4005157469798197354/comments/default/7350293884294143505'/><link rel='self' type='application/atom+xml' href='http://www.blogger.com/feeds/32869165/4005157469798197354/comments/default/7350293884294143505'/><link rel='alternate' type='text/html' href='http://freedominourtime.blogspot.com/2013/08/punishment-has-been-achieved.html?showComment=1376245130656#c7350293884294143505' title=''/><author><name>Keith</name><email>noreply@blogger.com</email><gd:image rel='http://schemas.google.com/g/2005#thumbnail' width='16' height='16' src='http://img1.blogblog.com/img/blank.gif'/></author><thr:in-reply-to xmlns:thr='http://purl.org/syndication/thread/1.0' href='http://freedominourtime.blogspot.com/2013/08/punishment-has-been-achieved.html' ref='tag:blogger.com,1999:blog-32869165.post-4005157469798197354' source='http://www.blogger.com/feeds/32869165/posts/default/4005157469798197354' type='text/html'/><gd:extendedProperty name="blogger.itemClass" value="pid-1089213995"/><gd:extendedProperty name="blogger.displayTime" value="August 11, 2013 at 12:18 PM"/></entry><entry><id>tag:blogger.com,1999:blog-32869165.post-4087659492991820598</id><published>2013-08-11T06:06:48.135-06:00</published><updated>2013-08-11T06:06:48.135-06:00</updated><title type='text'>Cops are low life scum,and so are their Mothers.</title><content type='html'>Cops are low life scum,and so are their Mothers.</content><link rel='edit' type='application/atom+xml' href='http://www.blogger.com/feeds/32869165/4005157469798197354/comments/default/4087659492991820598'/><link rel='self' type='application/atom+xml' href='http://www.blogger.com/feeds/32869165/4005157469798197354/comments/default/4087659492991820598'/><link rel='alternate' type='text/html' href='http://freedominourtime.blogspot.com/2013/08/punishment-has-been-achieved.html?showComment=1376222808135#c4087659492991820598' title=''/><author><name>Anonymous</name><email>noreply@blogger.com</email><gd:image rel='http://schemas.google.com/g/2005#thumbnail' width='16' height='16' src='http://img1.blogblog.com/img/blank.gif'/></author><thr:in-reply-to xmlns:thr='http://purl.org/syndication/thread/1.0' href='http://freedominourtime.blogspot.com/2013/08/punishment-has-been-achieved.html' ref='tag:blogger.com,1999:blog-32869165.post-4005157469798197354' source='http://www.blogger.com/feeds/32869165/posts/default/4005157469798197354' type='text/html'/><gd:extendedProperty name="blogger.itemClass" value="pid-1217815181"/><gd:extendedProperty name="blogger.displayTime" value="August 11, 2013 at 6:06 AM"/></entry><entry><id>tag:blogger.com,1999:blog-32869165.post-6987538887071282881</id><published>2013-08-11T01:33:26.554-06:00</published><updated>2013-08-11T01:33:26.554-06:00</updated><title type='text'>It&amp;#39;s quite apparent that Greenbank is a pathol...</title><content type='html'>It&amp;#39;s quite apparent that Greenbank is a pathologic personality.  Such people do not stop their abusive conduct voluntarily.  They